This extension adds Mortal Kombat 1 modding support to Vortex Mod Manager.

[b]✅ Supported Versions:[/b]
[list]
[*]Steam[/*]
[*]Epic[/*]
[*]Xbox (Game Pass)[/*]
[*]Other versions may need to select the installation location manually.[/*]
[/list]

[size=3][b][color=#ea9999]This game does not support symlinks. You must have the mod staging folder and the game on the same drive to use this extension.[/color][/b][/size]

[size=3][b][color=#f9cb9c]UE4SS LogicMod (Blueprint) Mod Authors - You MUST include a "LogicMods" folder above your .pak file in order for this extension to install the mod to the correct location. Without this, there is no way to differentiate between LogicMod paks and regular pak mods.[/color][/b][/size]

[b]🛠️ Mod Installation Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]Installs mods with both a "Content" and a "Binaries" folder to the "MK12" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a "LogicMods" folder to the "MK12\Content\Paks" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a ".pak" file to the "MK12\Content\Paks\~mods" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a "dwmapi.dll" file to the "MK12\Binaries\Win64" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with "dsound.dll" and "MK12TTH.asi" to the "MK12\Binaries\Win64" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a ".lua" file and a "Scripts" folder to the "MK12\Binaries\Win64\ue4ss\Mods" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a ".dll" file and a "dlls" folder to the "MK12\Binaries\Win64\ue4ss\Mods" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a top-level folder such as "MK12", "Engine" or "Content" to the game folder itself (no subfolder).[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a config file such as "engine.ini" or "game.ini".[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a ".sav" file.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with anything unrecognised with no pak file to the "MK12\Binaries\Win64" folder.[/*]
[*]Archives with a FOMOD installer (a "fomod" folder with ModuleConfig.xml) are handed to Vortex's built-in FOMOD installer instead.[/*]
[/list]
[b]📋 Usage Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]You can open several useful files/folders/URLs using the buttons within the folder icon on the Mods toolbar.[/*]
[/list]

